* ''The road to a stable house'' (operator, 2026-11-19: //"Approve a Fable researcher to get us past this blocker, burning any 'bridge' code that gets us to a new stable Lararium. Intent -> we stand a pono house, then sweep and clear all crud"//, then //"agree with this plan"//; lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/research/stable-house #/roads). The order: road (b), wiki islands keeping no store of their own, with Relock-Mender's cure narrowed to the daemon island's owned store (PR #316 landed); then `C16`'s event-ended wait and the meshpalace leak (PR #317 landed); then `rebuild`, stand, keep and census; then the document census door; then a re-found from that keep as the sweep, one evening of the paper rite; then the burn of the bridge list (research/stable-house #/bridges). Ranks 18a, 4h and 4l carry its steps.

